entityDescription:
The company's object, both in Belgium and abroad, on its own behalf or on behalf of third parties or in joint venture with them:
- Engineering and technical studies related to monitoring and securing space and space operations;
- Space surveillance systems, including the tracking of orbiting objects and the detection of space debris;
- Technologies for securing space communications and data;
- Design and implementation of security protocols for manned and unmanned space missions;
- Development of solutions to protect space infrastructures against cyberthreats and other risks;- Analysis of risks associated with space operations and proposal of appropriate mitigation measures;

